            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# PersonaStack 0.1.61

Release date: 2026-09-30

## Fixed

- Accessibility setup no longer rejects valid replies from the Desktop Control service.
- Accessibility verification correctly identifies its test controls and allows window and input updates to finish.
- Accessibility setup opens macOS Settings before running desktop checks when approval is missing.
- Accessibility failures now name the step that failed instead of reporting a generic screen-capture error.

]]></description>
